{"text": "Order Form Summary — Subscription Agreement\n\nAgreement no.: LSA-MSA-2026-00731 · Order no.: Q-118204 · Effective date: 07/01/2026\n\nPrepared by procurement for internal circulation. This is a summary; the signed Master Subscription Agreement controls.\n\nParties\n\nRole\tLegal name\tAddress\tTax ID\n\nVendor\tLumenstack Analytics, Inc.\t55 Fleet Wharf, 6th Floor, Baltimore, MD 21231\t47-2260918\n\nCustomer\tHarborview Dental Partners, P.C.\t1200 Light Street, Suite 2A, Baltimore, MD 21230-4410\t52-1873346\n\nVendor affiliate (EU data hosting)\tLumenstack Europe B.V.\tKeizersgracht 418-II, 1016 GC Amsterdam\tNL861447203B01\n\nContacts\n\n- Vendor account executive: Kofi Darko, kofi.darko@lumenstack.example, +1 (410) 555-0114\n\n- Customer business owner: Anneliese Vogt-Ramirez, Chief Operating Officer, avogtramirez@harborviewdental.example, 410.555.0167 ext. 5\n\n- Customer technical contact: Paris Whitlock, IT manager, 443-555-0133\n\n- EU affiliate signatory: Jeroen de Vries, Director\n\nCommercial terms\n\nItem\tTerm\n\nInitial term\t07/01/2026 to 06/30/2029\n\nAnnual subscription fee\t$84,000\n\nOne-time implementation\t$12,500.00\n\nOverage per provider seat\t$95 per month\n\nPrice cap on renewal\t5%\n\nPayment terms\tNet 45\n\nTotal contract value\t$264,500\n\n- The first invoice (LS-INV-044817) is due August 15, 2026.\n\n- Annual fees are paid by ACH to the vendor's account at First Chesapeake Commercial Bank: routing 016990476, account 3300917452.\n\n- Overage is charged monthly to the corporate card on file: Mastercard 5120-5473-2514-8074, expires 03/29, security code 608, in the name of A. Vogt-Ramirez.\n\n- Fees for the EU-hosted reporting module, EUR 6,000 a year, are invoiced by Lumenstack Europe and paid to IBAN NL75 ABNA 4137 1832 64.\n\nTechnical and security terms\n\n- Uptime commitment of 99.9% per calendar month, measured in UTC; service credits under Section 7.2.\n\n- Single sign-on at https://harborview.lumenstack.example/sso; the first administrator account is pwhitlock-admin with initial passphrase tidal-crab-velvet-88, to be rotated at go-live.\n\n- Vendor will accept traffic only from the customer's office addresses 192.0.2.64 and 192.0.2.65, and from the on-premises data gateway appliance, serial number LSG-2X-00417729, at 10.20.0.14.\n\n- Vendor holds a current SOC 2 Type II report. Because the data set includes patient scheduling and billing fields, a Business Associate Agreement under HIPAA was signed with the order.\n\nNotes from negotiation\n\n- Kofi agreed to waive the implementation fee if the customer serves as a reference; Anneliese declined because the practice is in sale discussions with a regional dental group and does not want its name in vendor marketing.\n\n- Paris asked that de-identified exports exclude the two providers who are the only pediatric dentists in Federal Hill, since they would be identifiable from volume alone.\n\n- Renewal notice must be given by April 1, 2029.\n\n- Signed for the customer by Ms. Vogt-Ramirez on June 12, 2026; countersigned by Mr. Darko on June 15, 2026.", "kind": "Web page", "detail": "432 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Kofi Darko", "Anneliese Vogt-Ramirez", "Paris Whitlock", "Jeroen de Vries", "Kofi", "Anneliese", "Paris", "Ms. Vogt-Ramirez", "Mr. Darko"], "companies": ["Lumenstack Analytics, Inc.", "Harborview Dental Partners, P.C.", "Lumenstack Europe B.V.", "First Chesapeake Commercial Bank", "regional dental group"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Baltimore", "MD", "Amsterdam", "Paris", "Federal Hill"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["Harborview Dental Partners", "Chief Operating Officer", "IT manager", "Kofi Darko", "Anneliese Vogt-Ramirez", "Paris Whitlock", "Jeroen de Vries", "First Chesapeake Commercial Bank", "Mastercard"], "names": ["Kofi", "Anneliese", "Paris", "Jeroen", "Vogt-Ramirez", "Darko"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors":